# .claude/ and CLAUDE.md were ignored here until 2026-09-22. That made this
# repo the one stack whose standing operating instruction did not survive a
# clone: the rules existed on one machine and nowhere else, so a fresh
# session started with no instruction at all. The other three repos track
# both. Local-only settings belong in .claude/settings.local.json, which is
# still ignored below.
.claude/settings.local.json
.DS_Store
*.json.bak
node_modules/

